 data-s="ff2" onclick="event.stopPropagation();showMSInfo(this,'ff2');">ff2</span><span class="ms-chip" style="" data-s="l" onclick="event.stopPropagation();showMSInfo(this,'l');">l</span><span class="ms-chip" style="" data-s="q" onclick="event.stopPropagation();showMSInfo(this,'q');">q</span><span class="ms-chip" style="background:#f3e5f5;color:#6a1b9a" data-s="vg" onclick="event.stopPropagation();showMSInfo(this,'vg');">vg</span><span class="ms-chip" style="background:#f3e5f5;color:#6a1b9a" data-s="syrh" onclick="event.stopPropagation();showMSInfo(this,'syrh');">syrh</span><span class="ms-chip" style="background:#fff3e0;color:#e65100" title=": &ldquo;You have very often heard, holy brethren, and you know well, that John the Baptist, in proportion as he was greater than those born of women, and was ...&rdquo;" data-s="Augustine" onclick="event.stopPropagation();showMSInfo(this,'Augustine');">Augustine</span></td><td class="tc-word-cell tc-interactive" style="background:#f5f5f5" data-tip="cuando" data-lemma="ὅτε" data-morph="CONJ" data-strongs="G3753">ὅτε</td><td class="tc-word-cell tc-interactive" style="background:#f5f5f5" data-tip="enviaron (con emisarios)" data-lemma="ἀποστέλλω" data-morph="V-AAI-3P" data-strongs="G649">ἀπέστειλαν</td><td class="tc-word-cell tc-interactive" style="background:#ffe0b2" data-tip="hacia" data-lemma="πρός" data-morph="PREP" data-strongs="G4314">πρὸς</td><td class="tc-word-cell tc-interactive" style="background:#ffe0b2" data-tip="a él" data-lemma="αὐτός" data-morph="P-ASM" data-strongs="G846">αὐτόν</td><td class="tc-word-cell tc-interactive" style="background:#f5f5f5" data-tip="los" data-lemma="ὁ" data-morph="T-NPM" data-strongs="G3588">οἱ</td><td class="tc-word-cell tc-interactive" style="background:#f5f5f5" data-tip="judíos" data-lemma="Ἰουδαῖος" data-morph="A-NPM-PG" data-strongs="G2453">Ἰουδαῖοι</td></tr><tr><td class="tc-ms-cell" onclick="showMSSPanel('omit 𝔓66*, 75 א C3 L Wsupp Δ 0141 f1 28 180 205 565 597 700 892* 1006 1241 129