## Executive Summary

The NT (John-1) unified_analysis.html was generated by a **more advanced generator version** (v3, cached in S3). The OT (Proverbs-13) unified_analysis.html was re-generated from the **current (simpler) generator** which lacks most of the NT's interactive features.

The gap is NOT a data gap — Proverbs-13 HAS Hebrew morphology, LXX morphology, Spanish text, and xref data. The gap is entirely in **HTML/JS rendering code** in `unified_html_generator.py`.

